---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { localizedPath } from "../../i18n/utils";

const alternates = {
  es: localizedPath("es", "privacidad"),
  en: localizedPath("en", "privacy-policy"),
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How PuertaDelSol.com handles visitor data: no cookies, anonymous analytics only, in line with the GDPR."
  locale="en"
  alternates={alternates}
>
  <LegalPage locale="en" title="Privacy policy" updated="Last updated: August 2026">
    <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      In accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 of the European Parliament
      and of the Council of 27 April 2016 (GDPR) and Spanish Organic Law
      3/2018 on Personal Data Protection (LOPDGDD), please note the
      following:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Controller:</strong> Plus Ultra Properties SL</li>
      <li><strong>Tax ID (CIF):</strong> B86125986</li>
      <li><strong>Address:</strong> Puerta del Sol, 11, 28013 Madrid, Spain</li>
      <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +34 919 891 469</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Email:</strong>{" "}
        <a href="mailto:recepcion@lafondadelosprincipes.com">
          recepcion@lafondadelosprincipes.com
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. This website does not use cookies</h2>
    <p>
      PuertaDelSol.com does not set first-party or third-party cookies, nor
      does it use equivalent local storage techniques (such as localStorage)
      to identify or track visitors. Because of this, under the EU ePrivacy
      Directive (implemented in Spain via Article 22.2 LSSI-CE), no cookie
      consent banner is required. The map embedded on some pages uses
      OpenStreetMap, a service that likewise does not use cookies.
    </p>
    <p>
      Should any technology requiring cookies be introduced in the future
      (for example, third-party advertising), the User's prior consent would
      be requested through the corresponding notice, and this policy would
      be updated accordingly.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Data processed and purpose</h2>
    <p>
      This site has no contact forms, user accounts or booking system, so no
      personal data is voluntarily collected from the User. The only data
      processed is the following:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server technical logs:</strong> our hosting provider (Vercel
        Inc.) transiently processes the IP address and HTTP request data
        necessary to serve pages, for security and technical operation
        purposes.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Aggregated, anonymous usage analytics:</strong> we use
        Vercel Web Analytics and Vercel Speed Insights to understand, in
        aggregate, which pages are most visited and how the site performs.
        Both tools identify visits using a hash generated from the request,
        which is discarded after 24 hours; they do not identify any
        individual visitor or combine data across different websites.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      This processing is based on the controller's legitimate interest
      (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR) in keeping the website operational, secure, and
      continuously improving its performance and content, without a
      significant impact on the User's privacy since no identifying data is
      collected.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data sharing and processors</h2>
    <p>
      The technical data described above is hosted and processed by Vercel
      Inc., which acts as a data processor and relies on appropriate
      safeguards for international data transfers (EU Standard Contractual
      Clauses). We do not share data with third parties for commercial or
      advertising purposes.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Website contains links to third-party websites (accommodation,
      restaurants, activity platforms). Access to those sites is subject to
      their own privacy policies, which are outside the control of this
      controller.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Retention period</h2>
    <p>
      Analytics data is processed in aggregate and anonymous form; the
      temporary identifier used by Vercel Web Analytics and Speed Insights is
      automatically discarded after 24 hours. Server technical logs are kept
      for the period strictly necessary for security purposes, in accordance
      with our hosting provider's retention policy.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Even though this site does not individually identify its visitors,
      anyone has the right to access their personal data, rectify it,
      request its erasure, object to its processing, or request its
      restriction or portability. You can exercise these rights by writing
      to{" "}
      <a href="mailto:recepcion@lafondadelosprincipes.com">
        recepcion@lafondadelosprincipes.com
      </a>
      , with the subject line "Data protection".
    </p>
    <p>
      You also have the right to file a complaint with the Spanish Data
      Protection Agency (AEPD, www.aepd.es) if you believe the processing of
      your data breaches applicable law.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      This privacy policy may be updated to reflect legislative changes or
      changes in how the Website operates. We recommend reviewing it
      periodically.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
